    ],
    "text": "SERVICE MINUTE OF SRI LANKA TECHNOLOGICAL SERVICE",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      350.77,
      539.92,
      385.84
    ],
    "text": "THE following amendments are made to the Service Minute of Sri Lanka Technological Service published in the GazetteExtraordinary of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka No. 1930/12 dated 01st September 2015 and the othermatters and conditions of the said notification will remain unchanged.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      398.77,
      295.05,
      409.84
    ],
    "text": "01. Para 7.5(e) of page no. 7A shall be amended as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.45,
      422.77,
      539.94,
      469.84
    ],
    "text": "7.5 (e) I. Where there should be change of the training period of the applicants who are include in the training grade ofa particular post under the open or limited stream, on case basis according to the need of the relevant Ministry/Department, the appointing authorities concerned shall take action to include the training period in each schemeof recruitment after obtaining the approval of the Public Service Commission.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.45,
      482.77,
      539.89,
      517.84
    ],
    "text": "II. However, above Section 7.5(e) (I) shall not be applied with regard to the posts for which it is prescribed that atraining of two years or more should be obtained as per the approved recruitment procedures, except withregard to the posts for which the training period has been limited to one year at present on special grounds.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      191.85,
      530.77,
      392.87,
      541.84
    ],
    "text": "On the Order of the Public Service Commission,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
